# ─── Canonical site URL ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Single source of truth for metadataBase (app/layout.tsx), app/sitemap.ts
# and app/robots.ts.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://judge.norai.tech

# ─── Optional: Supabase auth (OAuth: Google + GitHub) ───────────────────
# Fully OPTIONAL and EMPTY BY DEFAULT. Leaving these blank keeps Judgewright
# 100% functional — every deterministic feature works with no backend, and the
# auth surface becomes a clean no-op. To enable: paste the project URL and
# anon (public) key below, then add the redirect URLs
# (http://localhost:3005/**, https://judge.norai.tech/**) to the canonical
# Supabase project's Redirect URLs list. Never put a service-role key here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ─── Optional: BYOK LLM diagnosis ──────────────────────────────────────
# There is deliberately NO API-key variable. The single opt-in diagnosis call
# is armed by a key the user pastes at runtime; it lives in memory for the
# session only, is never persisted, never logged, and never sent anywhere
# automatically. AUTO_DIAGNOSIS is off by default.
